els, DTC is going to remain relatively quiet as most of the MSRs that we have in our portfolio are low coupon MSRs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/04/rithm-capital-ritm-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"RITM 2023 Q4","e":"ritm","d":"2024-02-07","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Baron Silverstein","x":"And being in all four of the different channels that you see there, retail, wholesale, correspondent, DTC, and our partnership channel, we feel like we're positioned to growth going to '24 and going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/07/rithm-capital-ritm-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"RITM 2024 Q3","e":"ritm","d":"2024-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Nierenberg","x":"Irregardless of that, whether Trump comes up with tariffs, if he gets in or Harris comes up with her stuff, I think a lot of this stuff is going to be harder to pass.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/29/rithm-capital-ritm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"RITM 2024 Q3","e":"ritm","d":"2024-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Nierenberg","x":"While saying that, you have to think about the uncertainties that could be created if Trump got in, and for example, you had tariffs, what does it really do to the economy?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/29/rithm-capital-ritm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"RITM 2025 Q2","e":"ritm","d":"2025-07-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Baron Silverstein","x":"We are starting to see significant gains from our Rezi AI investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/rithm-ritm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RITM 2025 Q2","e":"ritm","d":"2025-07-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Nierenberg","x":"When you think about the tariff situation, obviously, the President and the administration, their deal guys, they continue to negotiate d